{"format":"rgate","version":1,"circuit":{"title":"Verilog LED chaser","root":"main","modules":[{"name":"main","gates":[{"id":1,"name":"CLOCK","kind":"clock","position":{"x":100.0,"y":90.0},"rotation":0,"width":1,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":100,"initial":{"bits":["Low"]},"pins":[{"name":"Z","direction":"output","width":1,"offset":{"x":13.0,"y":0.0},"net":1}],"text":"","show_name":true,"config":{}},{"id":2,"name":"RESET","kind":"switch","position":{"x":100.0,"y":180.0},"rotation":0,"width":1,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":500,"initial":{"bits":["High"]},"pins":[{"name":"Z","direction":"output","width":1,"offset":{"x":17.0,"y":0.0},"net":2}],"text":"","show_name":true,"config":{}},{"id":3,"name":"ENABLE","kind":"switch","position":{"x":100.0,"y":270.0},"rotation":0,"width":1,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":500,"initial":{"bits":["High"]},"pins":[{"name":"Z","direction":"output","width":1,"offset":{"x":17.0,"y":0.0},"net":3}],"text":"","show_name":true,"config":{}},{"id":4,"name":"REVERSE","kind":"switch","position":{"x":100.0,"y":360.0},"rotation":0,"width":1,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":500,"initial":{"bits":["Low"]},"pins":[{"name":"Z","direction":"output","width":1,"offset":{"x":17.0,"y":0.0},"net":4}],"text":"","show_name":true,"config":{}},{"id":5,"name":"SPEED","kind":"dip","position":{"x":100.0,"y":450.0},"rotation":0,"width":4,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":500,"initial":{"bits":["High","High","Low","Low"]},"pins":[{"name":"Z","direction":"output","width":4,"offset":{"x":0.0,"y":10.0},"net":5}],"text":"","show_name":true,"config":{}},{"id":6,"name":"chaser","kind":{"module":"led_chaser"},"position":{"x":400.0,"y":270.0},"rotation":0,"width":1,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":500,"initial":{"bits":["Low"]},"pins":[{"name":"clk","direction":"input","width":1,"offset":{"x":-45.0,"y":-24.0},"net":1},{"name":"reset","direction":"input","width":1,"offset":{"x":-45.0,"y":-12.0},"net":2},{"name":"enable","direction":"input","width":1,"offset":{"x":-45.0,"y":0.0},"net":3},{"name":"reverse","direction":"input","width":1,"offset":{"x":-45.0,"y":12.0},"net":4},{"name":"speed","direction":"input","width":4,"offset":{"x":-45.0,"y":24.0},"net":5},{"name":"leds","direction":"output","width":8,"offset":{"x":45.0,"y":0.0},"net":6}],"text":"","show_name":true,"config":{}},{"id":7,"name":"LED_BAR","kind":"led","position":{"x":680.0,"y":220.0},"rotation":0,"width":8,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":500,"initial":{"bits":["Low","Low","Low","Low","Low","Low","Low","Low"]},"pins":[{"name":"I","direction":"input","width":8,"offset":{"x":0.0,"y":7.0},"net":6}],"text":"","show_name":true,"config":{"led_display":"bar"}},{"id":8,"name":"LED_HEX","kind":"led","position":{"x":680.0,"y":340.0},"rotation":0,"width":8,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":500,"initial":{"bits":["Low","Low","Low","Low","Low","Low","Low","Low"]},"pins":[{"name":"I","direction":"input","width":8,"offset":{"x":0.0,"y":7.0},"net":6}],"text":"","show_name":true,"config":{"led_display":"hex"}},{"id":9,"name":"instructions","kind":"comment","position":{"x":70.0,"y":550.0},"rotation":0,"width":1,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":500,"initial":{"bits":["Low"]},"pins":[],"text":"Verilog LED chaser\nClock-step once with RESET=1, then click RESET to 0.\nRun or clock-step to move the lit bit. ENABLE=0 pauses it.\nREVERSE changes direction. SPEED=0 moves every clock; 3 every four clocks.\nDouble-click SPEED during simulation to enter a hex digit (0\u2013F).\nStop, select led_chaser in Modules, then Edit to change the source.\nBrowse HDL signals to probe chaser.divider and watch the speed counter.","show_name":true,"config":{}}],"nets":[{"id":1,"name":"clk","width":1,"show_name":true,"port":null},{"id":2,"name":"reset","width":1,"show_name":true,"port":null},{"id":3,"name":"enable","width":1,"show_name":true,"port":null},{"id":4,"name":"reverse","width":1,"show_name":true,"port":null},{"id":5,"name":"speed","width":4,"show_name":true,"port":null},{"id":6,"name":"leds","width":8,"show_name":true,"port":null}],"wires":[{"id":1,"net":1,"points":[{"x":113.0,"y":90.0},{"x":126.0,"y":90.0},{"x":126.0,"y":246.0},{"x":355.0,"y":246.0}],"start":{"gate":1,"pin":"Z"},"end":{"gate":6,"pin":"clk"}},{"id":2,"net":2,"points":[{"x":117.0,"y":180.0},{"x":129.0,"y":180.0},{"x":129.0,"y":258.0},{"x":355.0,"y":258.0}],"start":{"gate":2,"pin":"Z"},"end":{"gate":6,"pin":"reset"}},{"id":3,"net":3,"points":[{"x":117.0,"y":270.0},{"x":355.0,"y":270.0}],"start":{"gate":3,"pin":"Z"},"end":{"gate":6,"pin":"enable"}},{"id":4,"net":4,"points":[{"x":117.0,"y":360.0},{"x":129.0,"y":360.0},{"x":129.0,"y":282.0},{"x":355.0,"y":282.0}],"start":{"gate":4,"pin":"Z"},"end":{"gate":6,"pin":"reverse"}},{"id":5,"net":5,"points":[{"x":100.0,"y":460.0},{"x":100.0,"y":473.0},{"x":338.0,"y":473.0},{"x":338.0,"y":294.0},{"x":355.0,"y":294.0}],"start":{"gate":5,"pin":"Z"},"end":{"gate":6,"pin":"speed"}},{"id":6,"net":6,"points":[{"x":445.0,"y":270.0},{"x":462.0,"y":270.0},{"x":462.0,"y":239.0},{"x":680.0,"y":239.0},{"x":680.0,"y":227.0}],"start":{"gate":6,"pin":"leds"},"end":{"gate":7,"pin":"I"}},{"id":7,"net":6,"points":[{"x":445.0,"y":270.0},{"x":462.0,"y":270.0},{"x":462.0,"y":359.0},{"x":680.0,"y":359.0},{"x":680.0,"y":347.0}],"start":{"gate":6,"pin":"leds"},"end":{"gate":8,"pin":"I"}}]},{"name":"led_chaser","gates":[],"nets":[{"id":1,"name":"clk","width":1,"show_name":true,"port":"input"},{"id":2,"name":"reset","width":1,"show_name":true,"port":"input"},{"id":3,"name":"enable","width":1,"show_name":true,"port":"input"},{"id":4,"name":"reverse","width":1,"show_name":true,"port":"input"},{"id":5,"name":"speed","width":4,"show_name":true,"port":"input"},{"id":6,"name":"leds","width":8,"show_name":true,"port":"output"}],"wires":[],"verilog":"// RGate LED chaser example. GPL-3.0-or-later.\n`timescale 1ns/1ps\nmodule led_chaser (\n    input wire clk,\n    input wire reset,\n    input wire enable,\n    input wire reverse,\n    input wire [3:0] speed,\n    output reg [7:0] leds\n);\n    reg [3:0] divider;\n\n    always @(posedge clk) begin\n        if (reset) begin\n            leds <= 8'b00000001;\n            divider <= 0;\n        end else if (enable) begin\n            if (divider >= speed) begin\n                divider <= 0;\n                if (reverse)\n                    leds <= {leds[0], leds[7:1]};\n                else\n                    leds <= {leds[6:0], leds[7]};\n            end else begin\n                divider <= divider + 1;\n            end\n        end\n    end\nendmodule\n"}]}}
